      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاشِفٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 1; fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>]: see 1.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Water <i>freezing,</i> or <i>in a state of congelation,</i>
